      "aux": { "foreground": "color.status.success.border", "background": "color.background.default" },
      "kialo": "WCAG 1.4.11 asks 3:1 for the visual information that identifies a component, which may be its fill or its border. A status border that reaches 3:1 on the page identifies the status surface even when its fill does not, so warm brands are not forced into olive warning fills; text on the surface keeps its own threshold."
